  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-05-17T14:01:50.090Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is with VRChat 2019.2.2, build number 772. After a VR user's avatar has loaded in they look like they're temporarily in desktop mode with the default idle animations then it resolves itself after some time. This depends on how long the avatar takes to load in, the longer the avatar takes to load the longer they spend their time in \"desktop mode\". I noticed friends wanting to show me animations with their avatars but due to this bug I end up missing them. I see gestures but not their movement.",
